# T6.1: MIDI CC in for a grown row. In the warm snapshot the FX channel is 9 (status b8; found with
# scripts/t61-midi-probe.script). Variant grown-cc gives row 0x141 (chorus E, SHPE, k 70) CC 3 (CC 33 is the mod-wheel LSB, which the CC parser 0x40122eec takes before the table).
# Stock control first: CC 9 (chorus SPD, k 26) to 50. Then CC 3 to 3, 5, 1, 6 with time between
# them, so the ParameterUpdateCache flushes and swaps its two banks in between.
wait-emu 0.5
down space
wait-emu 0.1
tap l
wait-emu 0.1
up space
wait-emu 0.4
tap Down
wait-emu 0.3
tap Down
wait-emu 0.4
png 00-chorus
midi-in b8 09 32
wait-emu 0.3
png 01-cc9
midi-in b8 03 03
wait-emu 0.3
png 02-cc3-3
midi-in b8 03 05
wait-emu 0.3
png 03-cc3-5
midi-in b8 03 01
wait-emu 0.3
png 04-cc3-1
midi-in b8 03 06
wait-emu 0.5
png 05-cc3-6
